{
  "title": ".mypy_cache is not gitignored",
  "description": "Running make check creates .mypy_cache/ at the repo root, but \
.gitignore only covers __pycache__ (line ~85), not .mypy_cache. A careless \
`git add -A` will stage dozens of cache db files. Fix: add `.mypy_cache/` to \
.gitignore (and consider `.ruff_cache/` / `.pytest_cache/` if they are not \
already covered).",
  "status": "open",
  "priority": 4,
  "type": "bug",
  "labels": [
    "build",
  ],
